{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Bound cleanup after durable control flow is selected.** When suspension or retry wins while the handler is unwinding, this synchronous capture still waits indefinitely for handler `finally` blocks and subsequent end hooks. A blocked cleanup can consume the Lambda deadline and prevent the `PENDING`/`RETRYING` response. Bound finalization using the Lambda deadline while reserving response time, and test a selected outcome with blocked cleanup and low remaining time.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc773rWv","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":127,"observation_digest":"6ec73251afb79172b5df819eab72f4576db4e7c98213177322d26b0414aaf0d5","observation_id":"aro_v1_n3dteunpw6ixfno7qgpkw4xuk5","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:06:01Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vt34dnzhr72mh75qityehqrhqi","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"a43deba101516dc5a2fb5f51733728623cc57e1a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":127,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_pqwfza33rotnjasv5pbocdonbk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:06:01Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
